# 🔐 Cybersecurity Relevance

Understanding SSH is important for a SOC Analyst because SSH activity appears frequently in security logs.

You should eventually learn to investigate:

```text
Source IP
     ↓
SSH Server
     ↓
Username
     ↓
Authentication result
     ↓
Successful/failed login
     ↓
Commands/processes after login
```

This connects your **Linux fundamentals → networking → SOC monitoring → incident response** learning path.

